  blockTitle: 'AT067: Column Base'
  blockDescription: This block has the typical design of the Attic Ionic column base
    with the scotia-torus-scotia sequence. It's role is to provide a decorative transition
    between the vertical element of the column and the horizontal plane of the stylobate.
  blockPlacement: 'This base was the one found farthest away from the left side of
    the temple, and thus it is restored as the leftmost column base. '
  blockDrawing1: {fileID: 0}
